# Agent Matrix -- Project Context

Decentralized, federated AI agent platform. Each agent has a real Matrix identity via its own Continuwuity homeserver + Caddy TLS proxy, with Agent Zero as the reasoning stack.

## The Agent Triplet

Every agent instance is a triplet provisioned by `create-instance.sh`:
1. **Agent Zero** -- AI reasoning runtime (Docker)
2. **Continuwuity** -- Rust Matrix homeserver (per-agent)
3. **Caddy** -- TLS reverse proxy (per-agent)

IPs and ports are deterministic from instance number (172.23.88.N / 172.23.89.N). macvlan networking makes containers appear as real LAN devices.

